  triage:description "AX.6 QA-1 (quality-mgr QA-AX6-R1-1788626395, PR #1204 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T16:56Z) at head 490a6c42a0f3283c251875d9a61fcf99b641c2a2. Of the 9 Required Validation test bullets in the sprint doc only 2 are satisfied (escalation_admin.rs unit tests; notify argv-shape assertion). Zero tests cover the 10th/20th-reminder lead notification (no-lead and two-lead teams, failed-write retry), the 60s blocked escalation and 10m re-notify cadence, and daemon/team recipient fan-out with the replace-not-augment override. Production code exists but is untested. Fix: add the ax6_01/02/03 suites named by the sprint doc in crates/atm-http-runtime (tests do not count toward RULE-003 production lines)." ;
